<p>Responding to the Nitpick, I'm don't have many ideas for that. It was more just to have a premise to build off of.</p>
<p>The arc is still a bit shaky, but as of now the idea is that the SCP goes from being unaware to wanting to help contain itself much more than before, so I guess the big change is introspective during a final log/interview.</p>
<p>Otherwise, a large amount of the article will be devoted to the interesting events when the procedures fail.</p>
<p>I hope this cleared things up, and I'll try to update the original post to make that more clear.</p>

